    "question": "When should a case be referred to national AI ethics oversight?",
    "answer": "Draft guidance, to be confirmed against verified UAE sources: refer the case when an AI system is misused in a way that harms children, for example targeting ads using inferred disability signals. Stop the processing, preserve the audit log, notify the data-protection and education authorities, and refer the provider to AI ethics oversight for sanction and remediation. The final decision rests with the regulator.",
